      "statement": "DjangoFixup prepends the working directory to sys.path, uses Django's timezone-aware now, switches the app task class to DjangoTask unless a custom task class was given, and runs django.setup() plus system checks on import_modules unless CELERY_SKIP_CHECKS is set.",
